WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.393 --> 00:00:03.603
At TED, we're passionate 
about public speaking.

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:08.216
Whether sharing from a stage, a podcast, 
in a classroom or at work,

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:11.256
being able to effectively 
share your ideas

00:00:11.256 --> 00:00:15.095
can have a huge impact on your life 
and the world.

00:00:15.095 --> 00:00:19.155
That's why we've spent the last two years 
developing this:

00:00:19.155 --> 00:00:23.935
a new mobile app that's fully dedicated 
to helping you learn the arts

00:00:23.935 --> 00:00:29.532
of identifying, developing, 
and sharing your best ideas.

00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:34.016
TED Masterclass features 
a beautifully animated 11-lesson course,

00:00:34.016 --> 00:00:38.046
choice TED Talks that model the concepts 
covered in each lesson,

00:00:38.046 --> 00:00:43.908
and a continuous flow of exclusive 
insights from TED's speaker coaching team.

00:00:43.908 --> 00:00:46.478
You can move through the course 
at your own pace,

00:00:46.478 --> 00:00:50.865
and each lesson will help you master 
a discreet presentation skill.

00:00:50.865 --> 00:00:55.623
First, you'll learn how to identify, 
develop and distill your best ideas.

00:00:55.623 --> 00:01:00.033
Next, you'll learn how to prepare yourself
for presenting those ideas.

00:01:00.033 --> 00:01:02.652
And finally, you'll learn 
a variety of techniques

00:01:02.652 --> 00:01:04.727
that'll help you deliver your talk

00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:08.337
in ways that will resonate in the minds 
of your listeners.

00:01:08.337 --> 00:01:09.927
You can download the mobile app

00:01:09.927 --> 00:01:12.847
and preview every lesson 
in the course for free.

00:01:12.847 --> 00:01:15.157
And if you decide to purchase 
the full course,

00:01:15.157 --> 00:01:18.152
all proceeds will support 
the non-profit work

00:01:18.152 --> 00:01:22.127
of TED's global education initiative: 
TED-Ed.

00:01:22.127 --> 00:01:25.177
Learning how to effectively share 
your best ideas

00:01:25.177 --> 00:01:28.677
creates opportunities for both 
you and your audience.

00:01:28.677 --> 00:01:32.237
Take the first step towards mastering 
the art of public speaking

00:01:32.237 --> 00:01:35.386
by checking out TED Masterclass today.

